{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Element Fusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features six basic elements (Light, Dark, Fire, Thunder, Ice, Wind) that players can freely combine. Different element combinations grant towers unique abilities. By strategically pairing elements and leveraging their unique synergy effects, you can build an increasingly robust and unbreakable defense system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650100/extras/synergy_english.png?t=1746050586\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Team Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players can team up online to collaboratively devise defense strategies and fend off wave after wave of enemy attacks with your teammates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650100/extras/multiplayer_english.png?t=1746050586\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Campaign Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In single-player mode, experience unique campaigns where each has different types of enemies and new defense towers. Successfully completing a campaign unlocks new towers. As you progress through each campaign, you'll become familiar with the game\u2019s basic controls and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650100/extras/level_english.png?t=1746050586\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650100?t=1746050586","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650100/5eb97fe0aace9427ee74bdf8e16bc8c454ab37f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746050586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650100/86d75d9f3194a50071fb31bb4e6426e2ab11f8be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746050586","